  ('p','**How many people does it take to use the Evac+Chair 300H?**'),
  ('p','One. The 300H is designed for single person operation. The operator guides the chair down the stairs on its friction tracks, which control the speed of descent.'),
  ('p','**Can the 300H go up the stairs?**'),
  ('p','No. The 300H is an evacuation stair chair for going down the stairs. For upward evacuation, Evac+Chair makes the 600H, which has carry handles, and the battery powered Power 800 and Power 900 stair climbing chairs.'),
  ('p','**What is the dual-position seat?**'),
  ('p','The seat can be used flat, with zipped side panels, or as a hammock seat by releasing the side panels and fastening them underneath. The over-thigh quick-release restraint works in both positions.'),
